<title>SPAIN: Spain's Endesa details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Spain's Endesa details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full 1996 results for Spain's Endesa group, fully consolidating Fecsa and Sevillana in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>Operating income			    1,293.83  vs 1,296.89</p>
<p>Net turnover				  1,259.84  vs 1,261.28</p>
<p>Operating costs				 915.67  vs   939.60</p>
<p>Consumption, other external costs	 409.36  vs   453.16</p>
<p>Provision for fixed asset amortisation  187.72  vs   183.82</p>
<p>Other operating costs			 113.41  vs   107.89</p>
<p>Operating profit				378.16  vs   357.29</p>
<p>Financial income				 25.85  vs    38.72</p>
<p>Financial charges			     121.36  vs   153.26</p>
<p>Financial result				(95.52) vs  (114.55)</p>
<p>Ordinary profit				 298.90  vs   260.20</p>
<p>Extraordinary results			 (32.24) vs   (23.04)</p>
<p>Gross consolidated profit		   266.66  vs   237.16</p>
<p>Corporate tax				    69.98  vs    57.84</p>
<p>Profit before tax			     196.68  vs   179.32</p>
<p>Minorities					(31.59) vs   (29.46)</p>
<p>Net attributable profit		     165.09  vs    149.85</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
